1 SOUR CLAUDE_CODE_RESEARCH
2 NAME Ancestor research (Claude Code)
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
1 CHAR UTF-8
1 DATE 15 NOV 2026
1 NOTE Ancestors born 1930 or earlier, compiled from civil and church registers (FamilySearch), the Tötösy de Zepetnek family records, Hungaricana newspaper and funeral-notice sources, the family's own chart
2 CONC , and (for medieval generations) Wikidata. Living and recent generations (born after 1930) are deliberately omitted. Medieval Wikidata ancestry is filtered to exclude persons estimated to be born befo
2 CONC re 580 AD and known legendary or speculative figures (e.g. Ansbertus, Merovingian bridges, Norse saga kings, Rurik). Strict version: links described as probable, possible, inferred or disputed (in the
2 CONC  research notes or in Wikidata qualifiers/descriptions) are omitted, as are legendary figures and known speculative bridges (Merovingian links, Ansbertus, saga kings). The Thurzó-Jakusith-Drugeth link
2 CONC s come from the family's list. Remaining Wikidata medieval links are not individually verified against primary sources.
